I walk into the waiting room.
It is very quiet here.
Three other patients are sitting in the room.
They are sniffling and coughing quietly.
I do not feel good at all.
My head hurts a lot.
I sit down on a chair in the corner.
In the middle stands a small table.
Various magazines are lying on the table.
I take a magazine.
I try to read an article.
But I quickly put the magazine away again, because I cannot concentrate.
My ears also hurt.
I lean back in the chair.
Then I close my eyes.
Now I just wait.
Hopefully it does not take long.
I just want to sleep.
